      "mapName": "Sandro C.h3m",
      "regionText": "Sandro and Finneas Vilmar are going to wipe out Lord Alarice before he can tell the others of Finneas' transgressions against the old King of Deyja.  Once they have completed this trivial task, they will be able to work on removing other bothersome lords from the Deyja court.",
